d class."},{"t":[83.3,84],"en":"- But I'm right."},{"t":[84,87],"en":"- Yeah, you're right about the difference between a man and a woman, but not about the punchline"},{"t":[87,88],"en":"to the joke."},{"t":[88,89.1],"en":"Right?"},{"t":[89.1,93.4],"en":"- The difference between a salesman and a saleswoman is boobs."},{"t":[93.4,96.3],"en":"- Hey, do you remember the speeches that you gave?"},{"t":[96.3,97.3],"en":"- I do, both of them."},{"t":[97.3,98.7],"en":"- Could I have a copy of one of them?"},{"t":[98.7,99.7],"en":"- No, no, they would remember."},{"t":[99.7,104.5],"en":"Look, it doesn't matter what you say, it just matters that you're saying something that"},{"t":[104.5,105.4],"en":"people care about."},{"t":[105.4,106.4],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[106.4,107.4],"en":"All right."},{"t":[107.4,108.4],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[108.4,109.4],"en":"Watch this."},{"t":[109.4,110.4],"en":"Attention, everybody."},{"t":[110.4,111.4],"en":"Attention, please."},{"t":[111.4,114],"en":"I have some very great news from corporate."},{"t":[114,119.9],"en":"We had a wonderful quarter, and as a result, all of you are getting bonuses for $1,000."},{"t":[119.9,120.9],"en":"- Yeah!"},{"t":[120.9,122.3],"en":"- Congratulations."},{"t":[128.3,129.3],"en":"- You see that?"},{"t":[129.3,130.5],"en":"You see how they responded to me?"},{"t":[130.5,132.6],"en":"In that moment, I had them."},{"t":[132.6,134.4],"en":"- That is so great about the bonus."},{"t":[134.4,136],"en":"- No, no, it's not true."},{"t":[136,137.5],"en":"I was just talking."},{"t":[137.5,140.2],"en":"So just go out there and say anything."},{"t":[140.2,141],"en":"Delete it up."},{"t":[141,142.3],"en":"They're a great audience."},{"t":[142.3,144.3],"en":"Go ahead, get the wallpaper."},{"t":[144.3,145.8],"en":"Wallpaper to the ceiling, if you want."},{"t":[145.8,146.5],"en":"- Excuse me?"},{"t":[146.5,147.6],"en":"- Charing and tunnel machine."},{"t":[147.6,149.5],"en":"- May I have your attention, please?"},{"t":[149.5,153],"en":"There has been an accident on 84 West."},{"t":[153,156.1],"en":"Cars have skidded off the road into the safety railing."},{"t":[156.1,157.9],"en":"Several cars have flipped."},{"t":[157.9,159.7],"en":"There is broken glass everywhere."},{"t":[159.7,162],"en":"Several people are injured."},{"t":[162,165.5],"en":"- Do we know anyone who was in the accident?"},{"t":[165.5,168.9],"en":"- Brad Pitt."},{"t":[168.9,170.7],"en":"Also, there will be no bonuses."},{"t":[170.7,172.7],"en":"Why would this affect our bonuses?"},{"t":[172.7,173.6],"en":"- They're unrelated."},{"t":[173.6,174.8],"en":"- Is Brad okay?"},{"t":[174.8,176.8],"en":"- He will never act again."},{"t":[176.8,179],"en":"Also, this branch is closing."},{"t":[179,180.2],"en":"- What the hell's going on here?"},{"t":[180.2,181.3],"en":"- Are we out of jobs?"},{"t":[181.3,182.1],"en":"- Yes."},{"t":[182.1,184.7],"en":"- This is karma because of what he did to Jennifer Aniston."},{"t":[184.7,185.5],"en":"- I was kidding."},{"t":[185.5,186.4],"en":"Dwight was kidding."},{"t":[186.4,189.1],"en":"And I don't know why, because it wasn't funny"},{"t":[189.1,190.9],"en":"and it was just horrible."},{"t":[191.7,192.9],"en":"- Michael. - Yeah."},{"t":[192.9,194.3],"en":"- You said we were getting bonuses."},{"t":[194.3,196.4],"en":"- All right, everybody in the conference room now."},{"t":[196.4,197.4],"en":"Let's go."},{"t":[197.4,198.2],"en":"Let's do it."},{"t":[198.2,218.8],"en":"Let's do it."}]}
